+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command under its original name, kept so existing scripts keep working.
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
\ No newline at end of file
